128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (Cryptocurrency has several potential advantages that have contributed to its popularity. One major advantage is the possibility of transferring digital assets across borders without relying on the same traditional payment infrastructure used by banks. Some cryptocurrency networks operate continuously, meaning transactions can be initiated at any time rather than being restricted to conventional banking hours. It identifies fast global transactions, high return potential, 24/7 availability, and blockchain security as advantages.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 81 0 R
/E (                            Blockchain-based systems can also provide transparent transaction records, depending on the particular network. Another potential advantage is programmability. Blockchain platforms such as Ethereum can support smart contracts, which are programs that automatically execute actions when specified conditions are met. Cryptocurrency can also provide access to certain financial applications without requiring traditional intermediaries.However, these advantages should not be interpreted)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
