134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (Although cryptocurrency offers new technological possibilities, it also has significant disadvantages and risks. One of the most important concerns is price volatility. Cryptocurrency prices can change rapidly, which means that the value of a digital asset may increase or decrease significantly within a short period.  It identifies highly volatile prices, hacking risks, scams and fraud, and limited government regulation as major disadvantages and it affects.Security is another concern. Cryptocurrency users may face phishing attacks, fraudulent websites, fake investment schemes, compromised accounts, and malicious software. If private keys or recovery information are lost or stolen, recovering assets may be extremely difficult.There are also risks associated with cryptocurrency exchanges and other third-party services.In addition, the legal)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (as guarantees. Transaction speed and cost vary between networks, and some blockchain systems can become congested. Similarly, the possibility of high returns is connected with high risk because cryptocurrency prices can rise or fall significantly. Blockchain security also depends on the design of the network and the security of the applications, wallets, and exchanges built around it. Therefore, cryptocurrency's advantages need to be considered together with its limitations and risks.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
