144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (The future of cryptocurrency is likely to depend on technological development, public adoption, regulation, security, and its ability to provide useful applications. Blockchain technology is continuing to develop, with researchers and companies working on improvements in scalability, transaction efficiency, interoperability, privacy, and security. Cryptocurrency may continue to be used in digital payments, international transfers, decentralized applications, financial services, gaming, and digital ownership.At the same time, governments and financial authorities around the world are)
